# Test Cases — Program Rematching After Submission Window Expiry

**System under test:** Meterwise (incentive claim matching engine)
**Scope:** Residential heat pump and heat pump water heater sales matched to a regional
program must re-evaluate program eligibility once the 60-day submission window has passed,
with jurisdiction-dependent fallback behavior.

> Sanitized example from professional work. Program names are fictional stand-ins and
> jurisdictions are anonymized as State A–D; identifiers are synthetic.

## Programs referenced

| Short name | Description |
| --- | --- |
| NHPP HVAC | Regional heat pump program — HVAC measure. 60-day submission window from invoice date. |
| NHPP WH | Regional heat pump program — water heater measure. 60-day submission window from invoice date. |
| State A Resi HVAC | State-level residential HVAC program. Fallback for State A/B/C HVAC sales. |
| State A WH | State-level residential water heater program. Fallback for State A/B/C WH sales. |

